Adamantium change to Vulkan-ExtensionLayer (Apache-2.0), applied by build.sh and build.ps1 before building.

The layer chains a VkShaderDescriptorSetAndBindingMappingInfoEXT into every pipeline stage it creates, even when the
shader has no mappings. That is valid - the structure is ignored for a pipeline made with a pipeline layout - but Mesa's
common pipeline code lowers the shader as a descriptor-heap one whenever the structure is present and, for any sampler,
dereferences the mapping it does not find: KosmicKrisp crashes compiling every shader that samples. The mapping info
is now chained only when the shader has mappings, so a shader on descriptor sets never shows Mesa the structure.

